            <li>Doesn't preserve full conversational detail</li>
            <li>Requires extraction logic</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Technique 6: Hierarchical Summarization -->
  <div class=3D"pipe-block">
    <div class=3D"pipe-num" style=3D"background:#2a2060;color:var(--accent2=
);">6</div>
    <div class=3D"pipe-body">
      <div class=3D"pipe-title" style=3D"color:var(--accent2)">Hierarchical=
 Summarization</div>
      <div class=3D"pipe-subtitle">Create summaries at multiple levels - fo=
r extremely long conversations.</div>
      <div class=3D"formula">100 Messages
      =E2=86=93
10 Summaries (per chunk)
      =E2=86=93
1 Higher-Level Summary</div>
      <div class=3D"pipe-tags">
        <span class=3D"tag">Multi-level</span>
        <span class=3D"tag blue">RAPTOR-style</span>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"pros-cons">
        <div class=3D"pros">
          <h4>Pros</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Handles extremely long conversations</li>
            <li>Coarse summaries for high-level questions</li>
            <li>Leaf summaries for detail questions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"cons">
          <h4>Cons</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Risk of information loss across layers</li>
            <li>Multiple LLM calls per compression cycle</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Technique 7: Context Compression -->
  <div class=3D"pipe-block">
    <div class=3D"pipe-num" style=3D"background:#0d2e24;color:var(--accent3=
);">7</div>
