      <div class=3D"pros-cons">
        <div class=3D"pros">
          <h4>Pros</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>More detailed than simple summarization</li>
            <li>Preserves tone, intent, and nuance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"cons">
          <h4>Cons</h4>
